      413     with title "Выгрузка всех партий свободной зоны" attr-space side-labels view-as dialog-box.
      414   on choose of btn-dir in frame f-dialog do :
      415     run gbl/dir-sel.p
      416        ( output v-dir-name
      417         ,output v-type
      418         ,output v-can-write
      419         ).
      420     display v-dir-name with frame f-dialog .
